Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 23:12:26 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] tests: drop legacy egis0570 replay of a 1c7a:0570 capture

1c7a:0570 is now handled by egis0570touch; the legacy swipe driver keeps
1c7a:0571 only, so the old 0570 umockdev recording no longer probes a
capture-capable device. A touch-path replay test is still to be recorded.
---
 tests/meson.build | 1 -
 1 file changed, 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/tests/meson.build b/tests/meson.build
index a7e55a5..0759855 100644
--- a/tests/meson.build
+++ b/tests/meson.build
@@ -50,7 +50,6 @@ drivers_tests = {
     'vfs7552': {},
     'goodixmoc': {},
     'nb1010': {},
-    'egis0570': {},
     'egismoc': {},
     'egis_etu905': {},
     'egismoc-05a1': {},
